  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef is playing a game with two sequences of non-negative integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ and B1,B2,…,BMB_1, B_2, \\ldots, B_MB1​,B2​,…,BM​. He has an integer VVV, which is initially equal to 000. Chef will play for a number of turns he chooses (possibly zero); he stops playing when he gets bored. In each turn of the game, Chef must perform one of the following operations:\n\n\nChoose an integer XXX from AAA and change VVV to V∨XV \\lor XV∨X, i.e. the bitwise OR of VVV and XXX.\nChoose an integer XXX from BBB and change VVV to V∧XV \\land XV∧X, i.e. the bitwise AND of VVV and XXX.\nFind the number of possible distinct values which VVV can have after the game ends.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N,M≤2201 \\leq N,M \\leq 2^{20}1≤N,M≤220",
      "0≤Ai&lt;2200 \\leq A_i \\lt 2^{20}0≤Ai​&lt;220 for each valid iii",
      "0≤Bi&lt;2200 \\leq B_i \\lt 2^{20}0≤Bi​&lt;220 for each valid iii",
      "A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ are pairwise distinct",
      "B1,B2,…,BMB_1, B_2, \\ldots, B_MB1​,B2​,…,BM​ are pairwise distinct",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 2202^{20}220",
      "the sum of MMM over all test cases does not exceed 2202^{20}220",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (30 points, time limit 2 seconds):**",
      "1≤N,M≤2101 \\leq N,M \\leq 2^{10}1≤N,M≤210",
      "0≤Ai&lt;2100 \\leq A_i \\lt 2^{10}0≤Ai​&lt;210 for each valid iii",
      "0≤Bi&lt;2100 \\leq B_i \\lt 2^{10}0≤Bi​&lt;210 for each valid iii",
      "**Subtask #2 (30 points, time limit 2 seconds):**",
      "1≤N,M≤2151 \\leq N,M \\leq 2^{15}1≤N,M≤215",
      "0≤Ai&lt;2150 \\leq A_i \\lt 2^{15}0≤Ai​&lt;215 for each valid iii",
      "0≤Bi&lt;2150 \\leq B_i \\lt 2^{15}0≤Bi​&lt;215 for each valid iii"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and MMM.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\nThe third line contains MMM space-separated integers B1,B2,…,BMB_1, B_2, \\ldots, B_MB1​,B2​,…,BM​.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case, print a single line containing one integer ― the number of possible values of VVV after the game ends.",
